OL,3,GNEWSABBC gives #450m boost to Greater
OL,4,AManchester - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC contributed #450m to Greater
OL,7,FManchester's economy in 2024-25 and
OL,8,Fsupported more than 5,000 jobs,
OL,9,Faccording to a new report.
OL,11,FThe figures have been released as part
OL,12,Fof the BBC's Made Of Greater Manchester
OL,13,Fcampaign, marking 15 years since the
OL,14,FBBC moved key departments to Media City
OL,15,Fin Salford.
OL,17,FThe report by BBC economists said BBC
OL,18,Factivity accounted for 39% of the city
OL,19,Fregion's audiovisual production and
OL,20,Fbroadcasting sector and the corporation
OL,21,Femployed more than 3,000 people.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
